/**
 * The drum numbers (General MIDI percussion keys, as Guitar Pro shows them in
 * its Virtual Drumkit) and what the bundled SoundFonts can play of them. The
 * single table for the drum pads, numeric entry and the notation.
 *
 * The names are those of Guitar Pro 8's Virtual Drumkit
 * (docs/assets/gp8/gp8-virtual-drumkit-midi-map.webp). `docs/drum-midi-support.md`
 * says which numbers the SoundFonts play (generated by `pnpm drums:report`).
 */

